  "goodToKnow": "Der Darsteller is a performer who portrays a character, from darstellen (to portray). It's often used in credits and reviews: die Hauptdarsteller (lead actors), der Nebendarsteller (supporting actor), die Laiendarsteller (amateur actors). The everyday word for an actor is der Schauspieler. Darstellung is the matching noun for portrayal or depiction. No plural ending is added: die Darsteller."
